<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>GrandRP Divide items in house robbery 2 stars house</Major>
    <Description>This tool splits the stuff you rob from the house robbery in GrandRP into 2 parts per slot, so you don't have to do this work and you only have to carry the stuff from the location and don't have to split it yourself. If you have a lv 4 backpack, you can of course change the macro to your desired size or use this macro in other areas outside of the house robbery. But this tool is actually meant for that, as it perfectly divides all 3 different items (furniture, box of stuff, TV) perfectly. I used Full HD</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
